; =====================================================================
; ActionIndex.twk — the goHero NAVIGATION ACTION INDEX (God of War 1)
; Source: TWK_goHero (R_HERO0.WAD) /Animation/goHero/Navigation — two
;         banks of 100 slots, each aligned IN ORDER with the ELF's
;         ANI* action vocabulary (SCUS_973.99 @0x19e3f0). The engine
;         fills action slot N with the clip named in slot N — this is
;         the game's own action → clip binding table. ALL REAL.
; Bank 0 = the primary (armed) moveset; Bank 1 = the alternate bank
;         (context set — the two differ on jump/land/walk families).
; =====================================================================

ACTION SLOT             BANK 0 CLIP         BANK 1 CLIP         NOTES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ANIStand                standidle           berserkIdle          [banks differ]
ANITurnOnSpot           standidle           berserkIdle          [banks differ]
ANIWalk                 bwalk               berwalk             lab: stick locomotion [banks differ]
